<p> 9   Villa World	     8.93     1.12</p>
<p>10   Colonial Mutual	 8.88     1.20</p>
<p>11   Indu Property	   8.75     0.97</p>
<p>12   Equitilink		8.62     0.58</p>
<p>13   Gen Prop Tr	     8.59     2.34</p>
<p>14   Colonial Coml	   8.48     2.18</p>
